#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:2
msgid "Offline formats (PDF, ePub, HTML)"
msgstr "离线格式（PDF、ePub、HTML）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:4
msgid ""
"This page will provide an overview of a core Read the Docs feature: building"
" docs in multiple formats."
msgstr "本页概述 Read the Docs 的一项核心功能：以多种格式构建文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:6
msgid "Read the Docs supports the following formats by default:"
msgstr "Read the Docs 默认支持以下格式："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:8
msgid "PDF"
msgstr "PDF"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:9
msgid "ePub"
msgstr "ePub"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:10
msgid "Zipped HTML"
msgstr "压缩 HTML"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:12
msgid ""
"This means that every commit that you push will automatically update your "
"offline formats as well as your documentation website."
msgstr "这意味着你推送的每次提交都会自动更新离线格式和文档网站。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:15
msgid "Use cases"
msgstr "使用场景"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:17
msgid ""
"This functionality is great for anyone who needs documentation when they "
"aren't connected to the internet. Users who are about to get on a plane can "
"grab a single file and have the entire documentation during their trip. Many"
" academic and scientific projects benefit from these additional formats."
msgstr "此功能非常适合需要在无网络环境下查阅文档的人。即将登机的用户只需获取单个文件，整个旅途中都能阅读完整文档。许多学术和科研项目都能从这些额外格式中获益。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:21
msgid ""
"PDF versions are also helpful to automatically **create printable versions "
"of your documentation**. The source of your documentation will be structured"
" to support both online and offline formats. This means that a documentation"
" project displayed as a website can be downloaded as a PDF, ready to be "
"printed as a report or a book."
msgstr ""
"PDF 版本也有助于自动**生成文档的可打印版本** 。文档源结构同时支持在线和离线格式，这意味着以网站形式呈现的文档项目可下载为 "
"PDF，随时打印成报告或书籍。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:26
msgid ""
"Offline formats also support having the entire documentation in a single "
"file. Your entire documentation can now be delivered as an email attachment,"
" uploaded to an eReader, or accessed and searched locally without online "
"latency. This makes your documentation project **easy to redistribute or "
"archive**."
msgstr ""
"离线格式还支持将全部文档放入单个文件。你的完整文档现在可以作为邮件附件发送、上传到电子阅读器，或在本地访问和检索而无网络延迟。这让你的文档项目**易于重新分发或归档**"
" 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:33
msgid "Accessing offline formats"
msgstr "获取离线格式"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:35
msgid ""
"You can download offline formats in the :guilabel:`Project dashboard` > "
":guilabel:`Downloads`:"
msgstr "你可以在 :guilabel:`Project dashboard` > :guilabel:`Downloads` 中下载离线格式："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:40
msgid ""
"When you are browsing a documentation project, they can also be accessed "
"directly from the :doc:`/flyout-menu`."
msgstr "浏览文档项目时，也可直接从 :doc:`/flyout-menu` 获取。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:44
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:46
msgid ""
"If you want to see an example, you can download the Read the Docs "
"documentation in the following formats:"
msgstr "若想查看示例，可按以下格式下载 Read the Docs 文档："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:49
msgid "`ePub`_"
msgstr "`ePub`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:50
msgid "`Zipped HTML`_"
msgstr "`Zipped HTML`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:56
msgid "Continue learning"
msgstr "继续学习"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:58
msgid ""
"Downloadable documentation formats are built by your documentation "
"framework. They are then published by Read the Docs and included in your "
":term:`Flyout menu`. Therefore, it's your framework that decides exactly how"
" each output is built and which formats are supported:"
msgstr ""
"可下载的文档格式由你的文档框架构建，随后由 Read the Docs 发布并纳入你的 :term:`Flyout menu` "
"。因此，每种输出具体如何构建、支持哪些格式，完全由你的框架决定："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:62
msgid "Sphinx"
msgstr "Sphinx"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:63
msgid ""
"All output formats are built mostly lossless from the documentation source, "
"meaning that your documentation source (reStructuredText or Markdown/MyST) "
"is built from scratch for each output format."
msgstr "所有输出格式基本无损地从文档源构建，也就是说你的文档源（reStructuredText 或 Markdown/MyST）会为每种输出格式重新构建一次。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:66
msgid "MkDocs and Docsify + more"
msgstr "MkDocs、Docsify 等"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:67
msgid ""
"The common case for most documentation frameworks is that several "
"alternative extensions exist supporting various output formats. Most of the "
"extensions export the HTML outputs as another format (for instance PDF) "
"through a conversion process."
msgstr "多数文档框架的常见情况是存在若干支持不同输出格式的替代扩展。大部分扩展通过转换过程将 HTML 输出导出为其他格式（例如 PDF）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:70
msgid ""
"Because Sphinx supports the generation of offline formats through an "
"official process, we are also able to support it officially. Other "
"alternatives can also work, provided that you identify which extension you "
"want to use and configure the environment for it to run. **Other formats "
"aren't natively supported by Read the Docs, but support is coming soon.**"
msgstr ""
"由于 Sphinx 通过官方流程支持生成离线格式，我们也能官方支持它。其他替代方案同样可行，前提是你明确要使用的扩展并配置好运行环境。**Read "
"the Docs 原生尚不支持其他格式，但支持即将到来。**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:79
msgid ""
"Other pages in our documentation are relevant to this feature, and might be "
"a useful next step."
msgstr "我们文档中的其他页面与此功能相关，可作为下一步参考。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:82
msgid ""
":doc:`/guides/enable-offline-formats` - Guide to enabling and disabling this"
" feature."
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/enable-offline-formats` - 启用和禁用此功能的指南。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/offline-formats.rst:83
msgid ""
":ref:`config-file/v2:formats` - Configuration file options for offline "
"formats."
msgstr ":ref:`config-file/v2:formats` - 离线格式的配置文件选项。"

